# @volo-uti/volo-web-ui, the design system this package builds on, is hosted on GitHub Packages.
# Reading it needs a token with read:packages in your user-level ~/.npmrc (pnpm ignores credentials
# written in a project .npmrc) or, in CI, the one actions/setup-node writes.
@volo-uti:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
